flowchart LR
    subgraph Client[Mobile Client]
        Mobile[Mobile App]
        LocalCache[(Local SDUI Cache)]
        Mobile <--> LocalCache
    end

    subgraph Experience[Experience Platform]
        SDUI[SDUI Service]
        SDUIContract[(SDUI OpenAPI)]
        SDUI --- SDUIContract
        RepresentationCache[(Representation Cache - evolution)]
        SDUI -.-> RepresentationCache
    end

    subgraph Entry[Pix Entry]
        Decoding[Decoding Service]
        DecodingContract[(Decoding OpenAPI)]
        Decoding --- DecodingContract
    end

    subgraph Payments[Payments]
        Payment[Payment Service]
        PaymentContract[(Payment OpenAPI)]
        Payment --- PaymentContract
    end

    subgraph Platform[Platform and SRE]
        Observability[Observability Service]
        ObsContract[(Observability OpenAPI)]
        Observability --- ObsContract
    end

    Mobile -->|configuration and screens| SDUI
    Mobile -->|raw Pix payload| Decoding
    Mobile -->|payment commands| Payment
    Decoding -. normalized instruction .-> Payment

    SDUI -. logs metrics traces .-> Observability
    Decoding -. logs metrics traces .-> Observability
    Payment -. logs metrics traces .-> Observability
